# ClauseIQ Design System (UI)

Canonical source: `frontend/src/index.css` — **ClauseIQ Design System v1.1** (approved 19 Jun 2026). Do not invent new hex values; extend tokens in `index.css` only with owner approval.

## Tokens

- Colors: `var(--color-*)` only in components (bg, text, border, accent, alert, success, warning, ai, priority, z-index).
- Prefer CSS variables over Tailwind arbitrary colors (`bg-[#…]`, `hover:bg-[rgba(…)]`).
- Tailwind `theme.extend.colors` in `tailwind.config.js` mirrors the palette for rare utility use — do not introduce a third hex set.
- No fallback hex outside the palette (e.g. `#c0392b`, `#e67e22` are forbidden).

## Typography

| Role | Family | Typical size |
|------|--------|----------------|
| Display / page title | Playfair Display, Georgia, serif | 20–22 |
| Section / modal title | Playfair | 16–18 |
| UI body / controls | Inter, sans-serif | 12–13 |
| Meta / chips / labels | Inter | 11 |
| IDs, numbers, lang toggle | JetBrains Mono, monospace | 11 |

Do not use Playfair at meta scale (≤12). Do not add Inter/Roboto/Arial/system as primary UI fonts beyond Inter stack.

## Geometry

- `borderRadius: 0` / `rounded-none` — sharp corners. Exception: `borderRadius: "50%"` for status dots only.
- Card/nav selection: **3px** left border `var(--color-accent)` (not 4px).
- Prefer `0.5px` hairline borders with `var(--color-border-*)`.
- Avoid decorative `boxShadow` unless already established on that surface; prefer flat borders.

## Patterns

- Inline styles + CSS variables (house style). Mirror existing modules (Workspace, DocumentStatsPanel, ContractInForcePanel).
- Status chips: map to `--color-alert-*` / `--color-success*` / `--color-warning*` / `--color-ai*`.

## Audit commands (re-run before UI sign-off)

```bash
# Hardcoded hex outside the token file
rg -n "#[0-9A-Fa-f]{3,8}\b" frontend/src -g "*.{tsx,ts,css}"

# Radius drift
rg -n "borderRadius:\s*[1-9]|rounded-sm|rounded-full|rounded-md|rounded-lg" frontend/src -g "*.{tsx,ts,css}"

# Font stacks
rg -n "fontFamily\s*:" frontend/src -g "*.{tsx,ts}"

# Size ladder sample
rg -oN "fontSize:\s*\d+" frontend/src -g "*.{tsx,ts}"

# Shadows / overlays
rg -n "boxShadow|rgba\(" frontend/src -g "*.{tsx,ts}"

# Token adoption
rg -l "var\(--color" frontend/src -g "*.{tsx,ts}"
```

Compare findings against `:root` / `html.dark` in `index.css`. Chart series and hover states must also resolve to tokens (or new named tokens), not one-off hex.
